# Extra defaults for ArduPilot SITL when MAVROS connects on SERIAL0 (TCP).
# Without these, some builds default stream rates to 0 on the GCS port and
# MAVROS never receives LOCAL_POSITION_NED / ATTITUDE → no local_position/odom
# on the robot → odometry_conversion publishes no map→base_link TF.
#
# Tune per vehicle; values are Hz (ArduPilot Copter 4.6 SR0_* parameters).
SR0_POSITION 10
SR0_EXTRA1 10
SR0_EXTRA2 10
SR0_RAW_SENS 5
SR0_EXT_STAT 2
